\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 一句應許 \textperiodcentered\ 四個階段 \textperiodcentered\ 一位大衛\\
\textit{One promise \textperiodcentered\ four stages \textperiodcentered\ one David}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.2cm}p{2.2cm}p{6.4cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{階段} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
大衛興起 & 1-10章 & 統一王國的榮耀——定都耶路撒冷、約櫃入城、大衛之約 \\
大衛跌倒 & 11-12章 & 拔示巴——一夜毀一生；拿單的責備「你就是那人」 \\
大衛受苦 & 13-20章 & 刀劍不離家——暗嫩、押沙龍、亞希多弗 \\
大衛結語 & 21-24章 & 附錄與總結——大衛的詩歌、三勇士、亞勞拿禾場 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一位英雄的傳記，是來認出：即使是神所揀選、合祂心意的王，也需要一位更美的後裔。\\
大衛的興起與跌倒，都不是終點——\\
每一頁都在把你的眼目，從這位大衛，引向神所應許、國位永遠堅立的那一位。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not just reading a hero's biography — you are learning to see that
even a king after God's own heart still needs a better Son.\\
David's rise and David's fall are not the end of the story;
every page points beyond this David to the One whose throne is established forever.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
