\vspace{0.2cm}
\noindent\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
本書逐章研讀撒母耳記下二十四章，整合黃長老查經教導、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
並貫通詩篇與四福音書。
全書以撒母耳記下 7:16 為總綱：
「你的家和你的國必在你面前永遠堅立；你的國位也必堅定，直到永遠。」\\[0.4em]
{\itshape
A chapter-by-chapter study of all 24 chapters of 2 Samuel, integrating
Elder Wong's teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and
G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis — framed by 2 Samuel 7:16:
your house and your kingdom shall be made sure forever before me.}
\end{minipage}

